# FraudShield AI
## AI-Powered Multi-Tenant E-Commerce SaaS Platform with Intelligent Fraud Detection

**Project Type:** Final Year Project (FYP)

**Project Name:** FraudShield AI

**Project Category:** Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, E-Commerce, SaaS and Cybersecurity

**Frontend:** Next.js, React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS

**Backend:** Python, FastAPI

**Database:** PostgreSQL

**Machine Learning:** XGBoost, Random Forest, Isolation Forest and SHAP

