# 1. Project Overview

FraudShield AI is an intelligent, multi-tenant Software-as-a-Service (SaaS) platform that combines a fully functional e-commerce management system with an advanced AI-powered fraud detection engine.

The platform allows multiple merchants to register, create and manage their own online stores, manage products, process orders, monitor customers and analyze business performance.

The main innovation of the project is its integrated machine learning-based fraud detection system, which automatically analyzes incoming e-commerce transactions and identifies potentially fraudulent orders.

The AI engine evaluates transaction characteristics, customer behavior, payment patterns, order frequency, device information and other relevant indicators to generate a fraud risk score.

Merchants can monitor suspicious transactions through a dedicated fraud detection dashboard, understand why an order was flagged, investigate suspicious activities and make final decisions.

The platform will initially demonstrate its e-commerce functionality through a premium home decor store while maintaining an architecture that supports different merchants and product categories.

# 2. Problem Statement

Online shopping platforms face several challenges related to fraudulent transactions, suspicious customer activities, payment abuse and financial losses.

Traditional e-commerce platforms primarily focus on product management, order processing and customer experience. However, they may lack intelligent fraud monitoring capabilities that can identify suspicious transactions before orders are fulfilled.

Manual fraud investigation is time-consuming and may result in legitimate orders being incorrectly rejected or fraudulent orders being approved.

Furthermore, small and medium-sized online businesses may not have access to sophisticated fraud monitoring systems.

FraudShield AI addresses these challenges by providing an integrated e-commerce and intelligent fraud detection platform that uses machine learning algorithms, anomaly detection and explainable AI to assist merchants in identifying and managing suspicious transactions.

